This repository contains a modified copy of OpenAI's Lean formalization of
"An explicit power saving for the exact discrete Fourier transform"
(https://github.com/openai/math, directory lean/), licensed under the Apache License 2.0
(see lean/LICENSE-OpenAI-Apache-2.0).

Modifications to OpenAI's files (full diff in lean/OPENAI_CHANGES.diff):
  - lean/OAI/Computability/FourierTransform/TensorSaving.lean
  - lean/OAI/Computability/FourierTransform/TensorProgram.lean
  - lean/OAI/Computability/FourierTransform/Main.lean
Each modified declaration is marked "MODIFIED" in a comment.

Added (new work, also under the Apache License 2.0):
  - lean/OAI/Computability/FourierTransform/Grouped/
  - lean/OAI/Computability/FourierTransform/Colour/
  - lean/Check.lean
  - paper/
All other files under lean/ are OpenAI's, unchanged.
